<title>UK: CSFB leads 100 mln mark Venezuela-linked bond.</title>
<headline>CSFB leads 100 mln mark Venezuela-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB Effectenbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER VENEZUELA SYNTHETIC SOVEREIGN INVESTMENTS (JERSEY) LTD</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     10.75     MATURITY  * 28.DEC.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.125   PAY DATE  S-30.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.375     REOFFER    99.875    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> NOTES    * CALL ON 28.DEC.03</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.125     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	UNDERLYING VENEZUELA DCBS DUE 18.DEC.07 SERIES DL</p>
<p>		NO KNOCKOUT PROVISION</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
